  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  loadingScreenRoot: {fileID: 1944922465}
  progressBarSlider: {fileID: 559456101}
  progressText: {fileID: 1176957507}
  tipText: {fileID: 564900156}
  tips:
  - You can spend points gained from leveling up at the campfire
  - You can hide behind objects to avoid the guardian's laser beam
  - Fire Golems prefer to attack defenses over other buildings and the player
  - Golden points are given every 5 levels
  - Using the wrong tool for the job is very inefficient
  - Beware of your surroundings during a fight. You may damage your own buildings
  - Food is the primary source of health regen
  - Outline color indicates the rarity of the item
  - Leveling up regens your health and stamina by 50% each
  - Enemies get stronger and spawn more frequently as the days progress
  - Shift-clicking lets you quickly move items between inventories
  - Enemies won't follow you into houses
  - Most items do one damage. Rocks are the most accessible damage dealers
  tipDisplayDuration: 5
  fadeDuration: 0.5
  cooldownCycles: 3
